## 👥 System / Analysis Actors

The project design considers the following logical actors:

### Researcher
Performs security analysis, executes tests, reviews configurations, and investigates vulnerabilities.

### Packet Analyzer
Supports inspection of network communication and packet-level behavior.

### Fuzz Engine
Represents automated malformed or unexpected input testing used to identify potential implementation weaknesses.

### CVE Database
Provides information about publicly disclosed vulnerabilities associated with software components and dependencies.

