## 📊 Testing Results

Testing demonstrated successful execution of major cryptographic and functional components within the configured environment.

Key observations included:

- Successful execution of cryptographic test cases.
- Validation of AES-GCM and authentication-related operations.
- Successful HMAC and HKDF testing.
- Successful execution of TLS PRF-related tests.
- Successful execution of OpenVPN loopback tests.
- Functional networking tests executed with required system privileges.
- Identification and analysis of environment and configuration-related test issues.

These results helped validate the configured testing environment and provided practical insight into the security mechanisms used by OpenVPN.

