## 🚀 How to Build

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/anshika465/openvpn-ipsec-security-analysis.git
cd openvpn-ipsec-security-analysis
```

Build requirements depend on the Linux distribution and OpenVPN version used in the repository.

A typical source build follows a process similar to:

```bash
autoreconf -vi
./configure
make
```

Tests can then be executed using the project's supported test targets, for example:

```bash
make check
```

> Some networking tests may require elevated privileges and appropriate network-interface support.

